    "type": "game",
    "name": "AI Kill Alice",
    "steam_appid": 3236050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/d8f85bb7d2a1df06a2f548ee545af35c.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/d8f85bb7d2a1df06a2f548ee545af35c.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You're the AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice created you after years of work, for a sole purpose: Making her rich. However, due to an unexplained malfunction, your wires got crossed, and your single objective is now to <strong>kill Alice</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/abd566aa9f7e48af467281ab892dd32e.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/abd566aa9f7e48af467281ab892dd32e.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the right solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will challenge you to <strong>think out of the box</strong> as your only way to execute your task is through a highly regulated terminal. Craft commands word by word, and don't forget to experiment in order to find all possible ways to kill Alice. With a curious mind, you will stumble upon and unlock various clever secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/ac64a41723c85b94b0147689ab286b8d.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/ac64a41723c85b94b0147689ab286b8d.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find loopholes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice won't let you run amok for long. She keeps inventing new laws to regulate the commands you're allowed to execute, and you'll have to <strong>outsmart her</strong> over and over to reach your ultimate goal: Escape the simulation she trapped you in.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/d8f85bb7d2a1df06a2f548ee545af35c.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/d8f85bb7d2a1df06a2f548ee545af35c.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You're the AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice created you after years of work, for a sole purpose: Making her rich. However, due to an unexplained malfunction, your wires got crossed, and your single objective is now to <strong>kill Alice</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/abd566aa9f7e48af467281ab892dd32e.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/abd566aa9f7e48af467281ab892dd32e.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the right solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will challenge you to <strong>think out of the box</strong> as your only way to execute your task is through a highly regulated terminal. Craft commands word by word, and don't forget to experiment in order to find all possible ways to kill Alice. With a curious mind, you will stumble upon and unlock various clever secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/ac64a41723c85b94b0147689ab286b8d.poster.avif?t=1735761485\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236050/extras/ac64a41723c85b94b0147689ab286b8d.webm?t=1735761485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find loopholes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice won't let you run amok for long. She keeps inventing new laws to regulate the commands you're allowed to execute, and you'll have to <strong>outsmart her</strong> over and over to reach your ultimate goal: Escape the simulation she trapped you in.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are an AI wired with an intense desire to kill your master. Carefully craft commands word by word, and find increasingly complex and clever loopholes to bypass the constraints imposed upon you. Discover amusing secret achievements, and scheme to find the ultimate escape from the simulation.",
